  "about": "WP 4.4 golden: historical Guyton-Klinger cohorts run through the engine's own stepYear. 'published' holds the claims being reproduced, verbatim, with their sources; 'reproduced' is the engine's output pinned on 2026-09-26 for drift detection (it is NOT an independent reference — the published claims are). Portfolio: $1,000,000, one TAXABLE bucket, static equity share, rebalanced annually, no fees, no taxes, calendar-year steps.",
